<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-GRAVELAINE SUSPENDED FOR PUNCHING PAPIN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GRAVELAINE SUSPENDED FOR PUNCHING PAPIN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marseille striker Xavier Gravelaine was suspended for two matches by the French League's discipline committee on Thursday for punching Bordeaux's Jean-Pierre Papin in a league match last week.</p>
<p>Gravelaine, who claimed the former European footballer of the year provoked him, later apologised.</p>
<p>Bordeaux won the match 4-0.</p>
</text>
